      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是竭诚地为她尽心尽力。\n不足之处就靠努力来弥补吧。\n正当我重新鼓起干劲时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e22afd785192d849a2aa711537eac28d7e44c876cca875a1a3274e9566f18e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
